{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>《悠長假期》製作特輯陸續釋出不少拍攝花絮，男主角Edan呂爵安在劇中關鍵鋼琴比賽場口要求極高現場收音標準，被視為全劇亮點兼極具難度的致敬戲份，Edan更剖白真實感受。</p>\n<h2>Edan拍攝《悠長假期》現場緊張到腳震</h2>\n<p>劇組日前公開最新製作特輯，曝光多個鋼琴高手雲集及嚴陣以待拍攝彈琴場口的畫面。由於Edan日常拍攝行程非常緊湊，他只能犧牲個人休息時間，每日爭取在放飯空檔瘋狂練習琴技。面對現場收音要求極其嚴格，加上長時間缺乏充足休息，他在正式埋位拍攝彈琴戲份時承受著超乎想像的心理壓力，甚至在鏡頭前出現緊張到雙腳不停震動的真實生理反應。</p>\n<h2>Edan手寫樂譜頂硬上堅持重拍多次</h2>\n<p>為了應付初賽情節中1首原著根本沒有現成樂譜的曲目，劇組只能依靠工作人員反覆聆聽錄音並以人手重新編寫記譜，大幅增加現場演繹難度。Edan在受訪時直認彈奏該樂譜時壓力爆煲，他親自解畫：「有時緊張彈錯，嗰日每首都重拍4、5次，有少少瑕疵都想做好佢。」即使身體極度疲勞，每首曲目最終均經歷4至5次重拍才正式完成。</p>\n<h2>致敬《悠長假期》煞科翌日即時病倒</h2>\n<p>這次劇組為求向日本經典原版神劇致敬，不惜花費大量人力物力重新處理鋼琴比賽細節。Edan在毫無退路及極端高壓環境下捱過這段艱難時期，更在鏡頭前強忍身心不適直到最後1刻。當全劇組終於宣告順利煞科，一直處於緊繃狀態的他隨即在翌日不支倒地並宣告病倒，他坦言：「去到一拍完就即刻病，可能放下咗心頭大石。」</p>\n<h2>網民高度期待經典重現</h2>\n<p>相關製作特輯在各大社交平台發布後迅速掀起熱烈討論，不少觀眾對製作團隊展現出的誠意表示讚賞。大批粉絲亦被Edan堅毅不屈及專業態度吸引，紛紛湧入留言區為他打氣，直指「有Edan彈琴嘅片段，感覺唔同晒，期待港版《悠長假期》嘅播出」，同時也有大批網民留言讚歎「Edan琴技好勁呀」。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1794930084115629_12548153066afc75a47989e.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1794930084115629_12548153066afc75a47989e.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>劇組日前公開最新製作特輯，曝光多個鋼琴高手雲集及嚴陣以待拍攝彈琴場口的畫面。（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179493008577016841_1836330646afc75a646a7d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179493008577016841_1836330646afc75a646a7d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>Edan在受訪時直認彈奏該樂譜時壓力爆煲。（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17949300867869058_8901289736afc75a742de8.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"media-5\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17949300867869058_8901289736afc75a742de8.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>這次劇組為求向日本經典原版神劇致敬，不惜花費大量人力物力重新處理鋼琴比賽細節。（圖片來源：《悠長假期》）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17949300959453079_3495576356afc75b06a897.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17949300959453079_3495576356afc75b06a897.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>由於Edan日常拍攝行程非常緊湊，他只能犧牲個人休息時間，每日爭取在放飯空檔瘋狂練習琴技。（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17949300980308619_7134067506afc75b2d76bf.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17949300980308619_7134067506afc75b2d76bf.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179493010010426681_10793182306afc75b4a1e3c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"media-2\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179493010010426681_10793182306afc75b4a1e3c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T15:56:20.650154+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1185,"images":6,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T15:41:44+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T16:30:49.997712+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T15:49:46.572012+00:00","content_hash":"62406ed5606809ba10fa0672ed109b63ad0d79e43b429acafef11c58a49a5755","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}